\subsection*{2.2 Data Bus Encryption}
All internal transfers use AES-GCM-256 with dynamic per-cycle nonces.

\subsection*{2.3 Side-Channel Mitigation}
The architecture implements:
\begin{itemize}
  \item dual-rail logic,
  \item random clock jitter,
  \item constant-time ALU execution,
  \item operand masking.
\end{itemize}

\subsection*{2.4 Physical Tamper Detection}
Active mesh layers detect:
\begin{itemize}
  \item micro-fractures,
  \item laser probing,
  \item chemical decapsulation.
\end{itemize}
Tamper events trigger nanosecond zeroization of volatile key registers.

